<title>SPAIN: Spain's Rato says response to Telefonica sale good.</title>
<headline>Spain's Rato says response to Telefonica sale good.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said on Wednesday the response to the government's sale of its final 20.9 percent stake in Telefonica de Espana was &quot;very satisfactory&quot;.</p>
<p>Local press reports said the initial tranche of the sale was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>Telefonica was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
